loyalty management services, as well as operates mobile virtual networks. It also engages in the provision of outsourcing services, such as third party acquiring and processing services; software development; sales, and installation of hardware and software; money lending business; marketing of computer software solution, telecommunication, and hardware equipment; and provision of consultancy and maintenance services related to e-commerce, e-business creation, and management of website. In addition, the company offers merchant acquisition services; connectivity infrastructure and terminal equipment deployment services for electronic payment; and information technology and consultation services, as well as rents electronic data capture point of sales terminals. Further, it engages in hosting of customer loyalty programs for third parties; contracting of the card personalisation services; and trading of electronic gadgets. Additionally, the company offers incubation, programming, and analysis and design services, as well as operates electric energy generation facilities. The company was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Subang Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"ManagePay Systems Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，成立于2010年，总部位于马来西亚梳邦再也，为银行、金融机构、商户和发卡机构提供电子支付解决方案。公司通过金融科技服务和非金融科技服务两大板块运营。","lines":["金融科技服务：提供电子支付、电子货币、MasterCard预付卡、放贷、P2P融资平台及国内跨境汇款服务，客户为银行、金融机构、商户和发卡机构。","非金融科技服务：开发、营销和交易信息通信技术产品，提供项目管理、电子商务、业务外包和忠诚度管理服务，并运营移动虚拟网络。","外包与软件服务：提供第三方收单和处理服务、软件开发、硬件和软件销售与安装，以及电子商务相关咨询和维护服务。","商户收单与支付基础设施：提供商户获取服务、电子支付连接基础设施和终端设备部署，并出租电子数据采集销售点终端。","其他服务：包括为第三方托管客户忠诚度计划、卡个性化服务承包、电子产品贸易，以及孵化、编程、分析和设计服务，并运营电能发电设施。"],"lines_en":["Fintech Services: Offers e-payment, e-money, MasterCard prepaid card, money lending, peer-to-peer financing platform, and domestic and cross-border remittance services to banks, financial institutions, merchants, and card issuers.","Non-Fintech Services: Develops, markets, and trades ICT products, provides project management, e-commerce, business outsourcing, and loyalty management services, and operates mobile virtual networks.","Outsourcing and Software Services: Provides third-party acquiring and processing services, software development, sales and installation of hardware and software, and consultancy and maintenance services related to e-commerce.","Merchant Acquisition and Payment Infrastructure: Offers merchant acquisition services, connectivity infrastructure and terminal equipment deployment for electronic payment, and rents electronic data capture point-of-sales terminals.","Other Services: Includes hosting customer loyalty programs for third parties, card personalisation services, trading of electronic gadgets, incubation, programming, analysis and design services, and operates electric energy generation facilities."]}}